WEBVTT

NOTE
English transcription of on-screen narrative and explanatory labels.
These films contain synthesized music and sound design, with no spoken narration.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
The engineering.
Before an agent acts, what must hold?

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.800
Exact authority. Current ownership.
Honest uncertainty. Verifiable records.

3
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.000
Animated mechanisms. Selected repository checks.
Evidence levels are identified throughout.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Bind authority to the exact request.
A proposal is not permission to execute.

5
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Separate scopes: actions:propose / actions:approve.
The approval is bound to the approved digest.

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.000
EXACT REQUEST.
The request digest matches the approved digest.

7
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Schematic: separate gateway fixture tests and real hash computation;
in-memory repository.

8
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Change one parameter. The approval no longer fits.
409 · ACTION_DIGEST_MISMATCH

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Same idempotency key + different args: conflict.
409 · IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_CONFLICT, not a second action.

10
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A stale worker loses the right to commit.
Ownership advances. Old leases do not.

11
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.700
Current epoch: 3.
The kernel checks lease, epoch and version at commit.

12
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.700
Worker A, epoch 1: completeStep REJECTED.

13
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:41.700
Worker B, epoch 2: completeStep REJECTED.

14
00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.000
Worker C, epoch 3: completeStep ACCEPTED.

15
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.000
This protects kernel state.
It cannot recall a request already sent.

16
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Schematic: in-memory lease tests.
No live cluster or database durability claim.

17
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.000
A timeout is not an outcome.
Request never arrived; applied, reply lost; or accepted, not converged.

18
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Durable effect state: COMPLETION_UNKNOWN.
Uncertainty is preserved.

19
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Retry? Not from silence.
Mocked HTTP and controlled repositories, not a production recording.

20
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Read-only outcome query.
Adapter-specific evidence determines the result.

21
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.000
APPLIED: complete without repeating the write.

22
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
NOT_APPLIED: record that it was not applied.

23
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.000
UNKNOWN: preserve UNKNOWN; reschedule query.

24
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Remote query semantics define the recovery boundary.
Verified: query-first outcome classification.

25
00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.000
A hash is not a signature.
Signed original: Ed25519, bound to canonical evidence bytes.

26
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Altered copy: status changed from APPLIED to FORGED.

27
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Entry and content hashes recomputed.

28
00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Structure-only check: PASS.

29
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Signature check: FAIL.
The rehashed forgery fails signature verification.

30
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Verify with the trusted public key.

31
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Integrity and signing origin,
not proof of remote truth.

32
00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:41.000
Real evidence-bundle and Ed25519 functions.
Synthetic fixture; temporary signing key.

33
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Four constraints. One execution path.
Trust needs enforceable rules.

34
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Exact authority: changed request? Approval no longer matches.
Current ownership: expired lease? Stale commit is rejected.

35
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.000
Honest uncertainty: outcome unclear? Keep it UNKNOWN.
Record integrity: evidence altered? Signature verification fails.

36
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.000
Alpha. Working mechanisms. Explicit limits. Further validation ahead.
Selected component checks do not establish production readiness.

37
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Praetor. Engineering the right to act.

38
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Open source / Alpha
github.com/PStarH/Praetor
